   "lines": [
    "Heavy rain storm",
    "all day. Left",
    "Langs after break-",
    "fast; stopped to",
    "kill a few mallard",
    "flappers and white",
    "belly grouse down",
    "among ^a^ lot of",
    "slews, ^with rifle^ no lunch;",
    "overtook wagon at",
    "dusk, at Lake Station",
    "on old Keogh Trail.",
    "Heavy rain all",
    "night; no water except",
    "rain water from",
    "rubber blankets. Slept",
    "in wagon. Made",
    "fire of logs of old",
    "station house; good",
    "supper ~~[illegible]~~ fried",
    "duck."
   ],
   "rows": null,
